      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, so for this to work, you nee F-Droid Basic 1.21 (not yet released) which will include https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/-/merge_requests/1437\n\nThen, in Manifest:\n\n\u003cuses-permission android:name\u003d\"org.fdroid.basic.permission.UPDATE_REPOS\"/\u003e\n\nTo send the broadcast:\n\n        Intent().also { intent -\u003e\n            intent.setAction(\"org.fdroid.action.UPDATE_REPOS\")\n            intent.`package` \u003d \"org.fdroid.basic\"\n            sendBroadcast(intent, \"org.fdroid.basic.permission.UPDATE_REPOS\")\n        }\n\nThen, it may need pre-granting the org.fdroid.basic.permission.UPDATE_REPOS permission via xml files.",
      "revId": "24568b047f8de0c7734c67134393cf483a94da1a",
      "serverId": "35266860-6252-469c-a67d-185064479fc0"
